    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/7e75f0c9196c808d863c6ac6ea53858d.webp?t=1737500307\" width=463 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are thalassophobic, Achluophobic, claustrophobic, batophobic, or even teratophobic, you will be in an underwater <strong>nightmare</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/1dc7008d359a2b5f782bf3778e0567ce.webp?t=1737500307\" width=293 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the depths of Gornak and try to repair old underwater facilities <strong>to help the union</strong> and serve your sentence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/3f0c04c48392380627571d5baa641783.poster.avif?t=1737500307\" width=480 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/3f0c04c48392380627571d5baa641783.webm?t=1737500307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/3f0c04c48392380627571d5baa641783.mp4?t=1737500307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/c940af09bb596ea9eed827db7a7af2ac.webp?t=1737500307\" width=298 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will undoubtedly encounter the local fauna... <i>more or less dangerous</i>, but if you pray to Stiska you might find your redemption.. <strong>And even more in our magnificent submarine at the cutting edge of gornak technology !</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/aa03f21b23113b1877504a292403654e.poster.avif?t=1737500307\" width=696 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/aa03f21b23113b1877504a292403654e.webm?t=1737500307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/aa03f21b23113b1877504a292403654e.mp4?t=1737500307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/2f840f8ac3fc2cca209a14f8d434d3b6.webp?t=1737500307\" width=294 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To give you every chance of survival and success, you will come along your companions and pray to not be the last one <strong>drowning </strong>in these deadly waters. However, if you are alone, the Gornacian metallurgical union will help you as best as it can to prevent your death or worse.. The loss of a submarine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/348bf1ec4d582ec4647f22a07105ba27.poster.avif?t=1737500307\" width=480 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/348bf1ec4d582ec4647f22a07105ba27.webm?t=1737500307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/348bf1ec4d582ec4647f22a07105ba27.mp4?t=1737500307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/10a749d6be32e6388168f236bdf9591d.webp?t=1737500307\" width=486 height=53 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/7e75f0c9196c808d863c6ac6ea53858d.webp?t=1737500307\" width=463 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are thalassophobic, Achluophobic, claustrophobic, batophobic, or even teratophobic, you will be in an underwater <strong>nightmare</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/1dc7008d359a2b5f782bf3778e0567ce.webp?t=1737500307\" width=293 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the depths of Gornak and try to repair old underwater facilities <strong>to help the union</strong> and serve your sentence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/3f0c04c48392380627571d5baa641783.poster.avif?t=1737500307\" width=480 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/3f0c04c48392380627571d5baa641783.webm?t=1737500307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/3f0c04c48392380627571d5baa641783.mp4?t=1737500307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/c940af09bb596ea9eed827db7a7af2ac.webp?t=1737500307\" width=298 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will undoubtedly encounter the local fauna... <i>more or less dangerous</i>, but if you pray to Stiska you might find your redemption.. <strong>And even more in our magnificent submarine at the cutting edge of gornak technology !</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/aa03f21b23113b1877504a292403654e.poster.avif?t=1737500307\" width=696 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/aa03f21b23113b1877504a292403654e.webm?t=1737500307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/aa03f21b23113b1877504a292403654e.mp4?t=1737500307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/2f840f8ac3fc2cca209a14f8d434d3b6.webp?t=1737500307\" width=294 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To give you every chance of survival and success, you will come along your companions and pray to not be the last one <strong>drowning </strong>in these deadly waters. However, if you are alone, the Gornacian metallurgical union will help you as best as it can to prevent your death or worse.. The loss of a submarine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/348bf1ec4d582ec4647f22a07105ba27.poster.avif?t=1737500307\" width=480 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/348bf1ec4d582ec4647f22a07105ba27.webm?t=1737500307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/348bf1ec4d582ec4647f22a07105ba27.mp4?t=1737500307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995260/extras/10a749d6be32e6388168f236bdf9591d.webp?t=1737500307\" width=486 height=53 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Depth Diver is a single-player and cooperative adventure game where you go on an underwater journey alone or with your friends to gather resources and repair underwater facilities in dangerous waters.",
